      "description": "A bare `--depth` parses to boolean true; depthOf rejects it with a message printing `true`. The exit and stdout contract hold, only the message is unhelpful.",
      "suggestion": "Treat `flags.depth === true` as a usage error ('--depth needs lean or strict') before calling the resolver, as `--carry` does.",
